{"surah":62,"ayahs":["يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰوَٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَلِكِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُدُّوسِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">كِي</span>مِ","هُوَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى بَعَثَ فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مِّ</span>يِّـ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ـۧ</span>نَ رَسُول<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">اً مِّ</span>نْهُمْ يَتْلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> عَلَيْهِمْ ءَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>تِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>بَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحِكْمَةَ وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن كَ</span>انُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن قَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>لُ لَفِى ضَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ مُّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>نٍ","وَءَاخَرِينَ مِنْهُمْ لَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا يَلْحَقُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِهِمْ‌ۚ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">كِي</span>مُ","<span